<item><title>25/132 Woodend Beach Recreation Facilities Upgrade</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This Contract is for the demolition of the existing playground, the construction of a new playground and upgrade of the existing car park at Woodend Beach Domain.<br /><br />The main tasks involved in this Contract are:<br /><br />Car Park (Separable Portion A)<br /><br />- Earthworks to reshape, widen and raise the car park area<br /><br />- 1846m2 of chip seal road and car parking with provisional asphalt for turning area<br /><br />- 267m2 of chip seal footpath connecting to the car park<br /><br />- 333m of timber edging<br /><br />- 11 x new garden beds including top soiling and mulch<br /><br />- 3 x concrete pads<br /><br />- Line marking and signage<br /><br />- 47m of stormwater pipework and 3 x new sumps, including existing sump alterations and concrete capping<br /><br />- 65m of new stormwater swales<br /><br />- Removal of 151m of existing bollard wire fence<br /><br />- 36m of bollard wire fence and 65 individual bollards <br /><br />Playground (Separable Portion B)<br /><br />- Removal of the e...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 07/Oct/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2678<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.nz/tsi.axd?id=7b4f97925e304dfb8a215052292ad5dcs2678s85818252ab0f4a97ad4749bb758701e4s12</link>
