</item>
<item><title>Rangiora Eastern Link Programme Manager - third term</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Rangiora Eastern Link<br /><br />- progress appointment of designer<br /><br />- complete investigations<br /><br />- design and contract documentation<br /><br />- appoint contractor<br /><br />- carry out ECI<br /><br />- procure land<br /><br />- obtain consents<br /><br />- prep documentation to obtain construction funding<br /><br />Strategic and Business Case Services – strategic planning, and business case development for priority stormwater, wastewater and flood management initiatives. Provide advice as required. Examples include:<br /><br />Rangiora Stormwater Management Plan<br /><br />Mandeville flood mgt<br /><br />Oxford WWTP<br /><br />Animal Shelter - provide advice as required<br /><br />Development team - project management and specialist advisory services for other Council projects commissioned on an agreed, task-by-task basis.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 16/Sep/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2672<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Engineer, Research, Tech services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
